    "description": "### Impact\r\n\r\nThe moderation review queue can be susceptible to XSS attacks. This vulnerability only affects sites which have modified or disabled Discourse’s default Content Security Policy.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\n\r\nEnsure that the Content Security Policy is enabled, and has not been modified in a way which would make it more vulnerable to XSS attacks.\r\n\r\n",
